<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Prudential cuts energy companies.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Prudential cuts energy companies.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities analyst Frank Bracken has downgraded his ratings for shares in five energy companies, a source at the firm said on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Bracken cut Vintage Petroleum Inc and Belden &amp; Blake Corp to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- He also reduced his ratings for Cabot Oil &amp; Gas Corp, Lomak Petroleum Inc and Newfield Exploration Co to sell from hold.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
